# /research/ was renamed to /projects/ (2026-07-30). These rules keep every
# old URL alive, which matters for two reasons beyond bookmarks:
#
#   1. App Store builds already in the wild fetch /research/technology.json
#      and /research/projects/<folder>/index.md. URLSession follows 301s, so
#      those installs keep working until the next release ships.
#   2. Project folders lost their extra /projects/ path segment in the move
#      (/research/projects/X/ → /projects/X/), so the old deep links need the
#      first rule to collapse that segment. Order matters — first match wins.
#
# Served by Cloudflare Workers Static Assets, which reads this file from the
# assets directory. Nothing in the Worker itself handles redirects.

/research/projects/*  /projects/:splat  301
/research/*           /projects/:splat  301
/research             /projects         301
